// The city's texts (city.js) in Estonian, as the sentences take them: server in the genitive ("{server} server ei
// vasta": "Brno linna server ei vasta"), dataName in the nominative ("… praegu ei vasta"), dataShort in the genitive
// ("{data} andmete järgi": "Brno linna ja OSM-i andmete järgi"), techMap in the nominative after a colon ("Laadin: …").
